ision:4","quote":"筛选期：D-28至D-1（4周）；双盲治疗期：D1至D84（12周）；安全性随访期：D85至D98（2周）","quote_sha256":"5bca1c9f15bb68c6f868519610036e6de9a1db6868fd020039d38bc9d1d0223a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_003"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_003"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计的IIa期临床研究，旨在评价MY009212A片（VNN1抑制剂）在中重度活动性溃疡性结肠炎成人患者中的概念验证与剂量探索。研究采用3:3:3随机分配，将受试者等比例分配至MY009212A片160mg每日两次组、MY009212A片80mg每日两次组和安慰剂组，三组间随机比例为1:1:1。双盲治疗期持续12周（D1至D84），不采用受试者内剂量递增。研究整体分为三个阶段：筛选期（D-28至D-1，共4周）、双盲治疗期（D1至D84，共12周）和安全性随访期（D85至D98，共2周）。本研究不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、安全审查委员会或独立数据监查委员会。分配模型为平行组，中心模式为多中心，开发区域为中国。","rationale":"设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、3:3:3、12周、不递增、无自适应/期中/DMC/SRC、三阶段时间窗）均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）'不计划DMC/SRC'是否适用于全部120例规模；（2）安全性随访期2周是否满足VNN1抑制剂洗脱与AE观察需要。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_af656516dd217096","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012153806_909ba31f","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"治疗策略估计目标（treatment policy），FAS；补救治疗按治疗策略纳入；细节见SAP。","quote_sha256":"38d0b491c9a4084197e71b30c6315cb83bb540538b9734cb27326a2d23d6bef2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"每组40例、三组共120例（3:3:3随机）；探索性精度考量；见SAP。","quote_sha256":"26140b8581d87234f4564a9c2e93340332866c6464b61ff37532491a8ae1f345","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"FAS主分析：缓解率比较用CMH检验/logistic回归（双侧α=0.10，探索性）；连续终点ANCOVA/MMRM；安全性SS描述汇总；SAP另行制定。","quote_sha256":"54ebae8a148c04d798c8590356368a9bf1295f9d718766a2bd2833779be7217d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"Ib期研究：中重度活动性UC患者30例；单中心；开放标签设计；入组人群为改良Mayo评分5-9分；内镜子评分2-3分；对常规非生物制剂应答不佳且未接受过生物制剂治疗的患者。","quote_sha256":"40884ddd510ec0c8fa7f6d57484dae0801045f8f9d3b66d3d37a750dcf3bf5e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"单次/多次给药整体安全性良好；AE散发；未见量效关系；无SAE发生","quote_sha256":"a86a88ca440ba60b2936cd90fd3633db6e2f75190cf634569f09cddc02edf8c6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_010"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005","es_006","es_009","es_010"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索SAP或方案附录中PPS排除条款","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_42_01","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"4.2节PPS成员判定中'重大方案偏离'定义"},{"action":"确认120例是否基于特定率差假设的精度计算还是纯经验性设定","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_42_02","missing_source_classes":["样本量计算说明或SAP"],"target":"4.2节样本量计算五要素（率差/SD/α/把握度）"}],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划（SAP）中PPS具体排除条款","IIb期确证性研究设计衔接文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用治疗策略估计目标（treatment policy estimand），以全分析集（FAS）为主要分析人群。在双盲治疗期内，无论受试者是否接受补救治疗、是否因不良事件或其他原因中断试验用药品，均按原随机分组纳入FAS进行分析；补救治疗按治疗策略纳入，不因此将受试者排除出主要疗效分析。安全性分析采用安全性分析集（SS），对至少接受一次试验用药品或安慰剂的受试者进行描述性汇总。符合方案集（PPS）的构建规则及具体统计方法（包括缓解率比较采用CMH检验或logistic回归、连续终点采用ANCOVA或MMRM、双侧α=0.10的探索性检验水准）将在统计分析计划中另行制定。样本量方面，每组40例、三组共120例的设定基于探索性精度考量，旨在为IIb期确证性研究提供剂量-效应初步信息，而非以假设检验达到预设把握度为主要目的。设计依据方面，Ib期研究（30例、单中心、开放标签）已初步提示MY009212A片在改良Mayo评分5-9分、内镜子评分2-3分的中重度活动性UC患者中具有疗效信号，且单次/多次给药整体安全性良好、AE散发、未见量效关系、无SAE发生，支持在本IIa期研究中设置两个活性剂量组以进一步探索剂量-效应关系。","rationale":"估计目标策略、FAS/SS/PPS框架、CMH/logistic/ANCOVA/MMRM方法、α=0.10、样本量120例及探索性定位、Ib期设计与安全性数据均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）'细节见SAP'是否保留于方案正文或需展开；（2）PPS成员判定中'重大方案偏离'的具体定义是否在本方案中给出还是完全交由SAP；（3）α=0.10的探索性定位是否需在方案中进一步说明与后续确证性研究的衔接逻辑。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、估计目标、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_91663f15170f11f4","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012153806_909ba31f","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取I期/Ib期PK报告或本方案访视流程中PK采样日程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_01","missing_source_classes":["I期PK研究报告","方案访视流程表"],"target":"4.2.1节PK/PD具体采集时间点"},{"action":"确认PD采样是否与PK同步及具体采血日","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_02","missing_source_classes":["PD采样方案"],"target":"4.2.1节PD（VNN1抑制率）采集时点与频率"}],"heading":"PK/PD采集点设计依据","missing_source_classes":["PK/PD采样方案（具体时间点与频次）","I期/Ib期完整PK报告（含采样日程）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"t1/2约7-8h、BID方向性提示、非临床DSS模型数据（15mg/kg、AUC0-24约5606、人体等效约80.29mg）、临床VNN1抑制率数据（单次80mg+后24h>80%、多次160mg稳态接近100%）及首剂留观2h均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）具体PK采样时间点（如D1给药后0.5h、1h、2h、4h、8h、12h、24h及稳态日）是否已确定；（2）PD（VNN1抑制率）采集是否与PK同步还是独立时点；（3）W6、W10、W12是否安排稳态PK/PD采样。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_3aae12d8238d39c4","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012153806_909ba31f","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组；3:3:3随机至160mg BID/80mg BID/安慰剂，双盲治疗期12周；不采用受试者内剂量递增。","quote_sha256":"f5aa84b5556c73768b9bd9d1748dd3c3c59cafa00a217bf37a008213cf41f35c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es_001"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_0d2c837ebee7effc:full-draft:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","quote":"采用随机化分配。","quote_sha256":"abb7a27e76e1676c12ab199e8d9abdac80371053749a69fb6f2ee1faa8f01db8","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","span_id":"es_011"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"本研究为双盲随机设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。","quote_sha256":"202e6203bbc6cbaf71c237f934be73b9c60099c19f1e48aa487003f531a501c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_012"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"在研究开始之前由一名独立的随机化统计师撰写随机化方案，并根据随机化方案使用SAS 9.4（或更新版本）统计软件生成试验参与者随机表和药物随机表。","quote_sha256":"2af58e22b014ab3b878ffc223a0d7da2a1adfdb329620e03d0eeaf5666e1c189","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_013"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_011","es_012","es_013"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取随机化方案或向统计团队确认分层策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_01","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案"],"target":"4.3节区组大小与分层因素"},{"action":"确认紧急揭盲后是否终止治疗及是否允许重新随机","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_43_02","missing_source_classes":["IWRS操作手册","方案安全性管理章节"],"target":"4.3节IWRS紧急揭盲后处理规则"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案（区组大小、分层因素、随机种子）","IWRS用户手册或系统配置说明"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，随机比例为1:1:1，将受试者等比例分配至MY009212A片160mg BID组、MY009212A片80mg BID组和安慰剂组。随机化方案由独立于研究团队的随机化统计师在研究启动前撰写，依据随机化方案使用统计软件生成受试者随机表和药物随机表。随机化通过交互式网络应答系统（IWRS）实现，受试者在筛选合格并完成基线评估后，由IWRS按预设随机序列分配至相应治疗组。本研究为双盲设计，受试者、研究者、监查员及数据分析人员对受试者所接受的治疗类别（试验药物或安慰剂）均不知情。紧急揭盲通过IWRS中相应功能实现，研究者输入揭盲原因后可获知受试者实际用药，IWRS系统记录揭盲人员、原因和时间；受试者被紧急揭盲后终止试验用药品治疗。","rationale":"3:3:1:1:1随机比例、双盲设计、IWRS随机化、紧急揭盲流程的框架参照来源于当前项目已确认研究事实（3:3:3随机、双盲）及公司语料中双盲随机设计与IWRS紧急揭盲的监管共性结构。医学经理需确认：（1）区组大小与分层因素（如是否按中心或基线严重度分层）；（2）随机化是否采用IWRS还是中央随机化系统；（3）紧急揭盲后是否允许重新随机或仅终止治疗；（4）盲态维持的具体人员范围是否需在本方案中逐一列明。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_1393d72967279afd","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:86243689183ac2eb2cdd1b52","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5